00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:29.540
Here a law firm administrator authenticates into the role-based console, registers a new class-action settlement matter with a one-point-two-five-million-dollar escrow pool, sets the thirty-day court election deadline, and uploads a multi-thousand-row claimant CSV roster through the two-stage Zod schema validation and fund-variance preview modal before committing records to MongoDB.
